{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.82.4.242","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78865,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"94416985617499eeb0dbea62b56a8211","RawContent":"@[member=\"NikkiMarie05\"] is the resort charging you a vendor fee to bring in an outside makeup artist? Who are you using and if you don&#039;t mind do you have info on the pricing? Our wedding is May 9th! @[member=\"IzzyDeee\"] we arrive on the 6th! Good luck with everything. She is very hard to get info from. She will answer maybe one of three questions I ask.","Attachments":[],"Id":1890223,"PostDate":1426896039,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276426\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276426-nikkimarie05\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">NikkiMarie05<\/span><\/a> is the resort charging you a vendor fee to bring in an outside makeup artist? Who are you using and if you don't mind do you have info on the pricing? Our wedding is May 9th! @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282430\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282430-izzydeee\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">IzzyDeee<\/span><\/a> we arrive on the 6th! Good luck with everything. She is very hard to get info from. She will answer maybe one of three questions I ask. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Meggan.Kole@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.82.4.242","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385156577,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275259.jpg?_r=1421618186","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Megg","Id":275259,"Name":"Megg","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.236.130.168","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78865,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3fef605cc55abbd509f39002e06af381","RawContent":"Say the person is a relative if they are on your flight. My maid of honor is doing my makeup and I have a really close family friend who is a photographer who is coming for the entire week! Just going to say she is my aunt so you don&#039;t pay vendor fees. @[member=\"Megg\"]\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1890236,"PostDate":1426901567,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Say the person is a relative if they are on your flight. My maid of honor is doing my makeup and I have a really close family friend who is a photographer who is coming for the entire week! Just going to say she is my aunt so you don't pay vendor fees. @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275259\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275259-megg\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Megg<\/span><\/a><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"izabella.david@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.237.26.51","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1426465978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282430.jpg?_r=1434377756","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":287,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"IzzyDeee","Id":282430,"Name":"IzzyDeee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.228.159.228","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78865,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1b658e3388aa4767633760f95a109118","RawContent":"Are you doing programs? We leave in a week and a half... I probably could get them done but I almost feel like we don&#039;t really need them. \nChristina my wedding coordinator is charging me like $90 to bring the lady in from offsite and I believe it&#039;s going to be like $150 for makeup and eye lash extensions.","Attachments":[],"Id":1890424,"PostDate":1427086587,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Are you doing programs? We leave in a week and a half... I probably could get them done but I almost feel like we don't really need them. <br \/>Christina my wedding coordinator is charging me like $90 to bring the lady in from offsite and I believe it's going to be like $150 for makeup and eye lash extensions.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"np_2003@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.74.175","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391226066,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276426.jpg?_r=1425447500","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NikkiMarie05","Id":276426,"Name":"NikkiMarie05","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.236.130.168","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78865,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2591ae8d350f0c9b9ba7f4add30e1ab3","RawContent":"[quote name=\"NikkiMarie05\" post=\"1890424\" timestamp=\"1427082905\"]\nAre you doing programs? We leave in a week and a half... I probably could get them done but I almost feel like we don&#039;t really need them.[\/quote]I&#039;m not. I don&#039;t need the extra baggage; even though they aren&#039;t big but still! Everyone knows to show up on may 6th by4pm at the plaza gazebo to see me and my FI get married [emoji4] Might as well save some trees lol!!\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1890425,"PostDate":1427086708,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>NikkiMarie05, on 22 March 2015 - 08:55 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Are you doing programs? We leave in a week and a half... I probably could get them done but I almost feel like we don't really need them.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI'm not. I don't need the extra baggage; even though they aren't big but still! Everyone knows to show up on may 6th by4pm at the plaza gazebo to see me and my FI get married [emoji4] Might as well save some trees lol!!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"izabella.david@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.237.26.51","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1426465978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282430.jpg?_r=1434377756","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":287,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"IzzyDeee","Id":282430,"Name":"IzzyDeee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.228.159.228","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78865,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8beb64d381e44a6fa498b8dd7dbbb411","RawContent":"I&#039;m thinking the same thing... They haven&#039;t even told me the name of our officiant. Have they told you? Are you sending how you want your wedding script to be read?\n\n\nWho are you having be the usher and walk your moms down the aisle? I just realized that we don&#039;t have one! Lol.","Attachments":[],"Id":1890426,"PostDate":1427086862,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm thinking the same thing... They haven't even told me the name of our officiant. Have they told you? Are you sending how you want your wedding script to be read?<br><br>\nWho are you having be the usher and walk your moms down the aisle? I just realized that we don't have one! Lol.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"np_2003@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.74.175","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391226066,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276426.jpg?_r=1425447500","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NikkiMarie05","Id":276426,"Name":"NikkiMarie05","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.236.130.168","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78865,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cf9d6f09d0c6607bd6aad7302cf87f6f","RawContent":"No idea what the name is LOL, and we&#039;re doing a civil ceremony also! I&#039;m not going to have ushers at my wedding; the couples will walk together and my mom who is single will follow behind, then the bridemaids and then me haha!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1890427,"PostDate":1427087015,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                No idea what the name is LOL, and we're doing a civil ceremony also! I'm not going to have ushers at my wedding; the couples will walk together and my mom who is single will follow behind, then the bridemaids and then me haha!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"izabella.david@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.237.26.51","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1426465978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282430.jpg?_r=1434377756","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":287,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"IzzyDeee","Id":282430,"Name":"IzzyDeee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.82.4.242","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78865,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"92d8d224ae17914a15d6f00a2e218d31","RawContent":"Oh that&#039;s not as bad as the $350 vendor they are charging for our photographer. But the guy is taking that cost off his package. We are not doing programs. We have about 15 people attending. they all know what the plan is and of they forget, it&#039;s so a small group we will see them and tell them again.","Attachments":[],"Id":1890505,"PostDate":1427146383,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Oh that's not as bad as the $350 vendor they are charging for our photographer. But the guy is taking that cost off his package. We are not doing programs. We have about 15 people attending. they all know what the plan is and of they forget, it's so a small group we will see them and tell them again. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Meggan.Kole@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.82.4.242","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385156577,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275259.jpg?_r=1421618186","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Megg","Id":275259,"Name":"Megg","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":17,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
