> Time: 1436156131 / Mon, 06 Jul 2015 04:15:31 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=79028&start=10&SessionId=5d018559c6c18bf3de33692f3d307658
> User jms1698 (283240)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.226.143.164","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79028,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"521375e155d3677a7f203d125508bf2b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Beautiful!! Go for it!! And I agree with saying yes to the belt too! I remember thinking that I had to have a certain type of dress that was \"more suited for the beach\" going by different people&#039;s opinions in the beginning of the dress shopping, but then I felt super limited in the style options and couldn&#039;t find anything that I liked, much less loved. And then I found my perfect dress - which I bought over a year and a half before the wedding - and never looked back because I knew it was perfect for me and the wedding I wanted - beach or no beach :) So I am a firm believer that it is all about how it makes you feel and you shouldn&#039;t have to limit your options just because you are having a beach wedding. And you should be every bit of confident in that dress because it looks amazing on you! And after all was said and done I loved the fact that I had some poof and a train - even though a lot of people might have thought it was kind of crazy, I can&#039;t help but feel that it came out that much more beautiful (I&#039;m sure I&#039;m a little biased lol) - but the point is that it is your wedding day and your dream to come true... go with your heart!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892105,"PostDate":1428378801,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Beautiful!! Go for it!! And I agree with saying yes to the belt too! I remember thinking that I had to have a certain type of dress that was \"more suited for the beach\" going by different people's opinions in the beginning of the dress shopping, but then I felt super limited in the style options and couldn't find anything that I liked, much less loved. And then I found my perfect dress - which I bought over a year and a half before the wedding - and never looked back because I knew it was perfect for me and the wedding I wanted - beach or no beach <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> So I am a firm believer that it is all about how it makes you feel and you shouldn't have to limit your options just because you are having a beach wedding. And you should be every bit of confident in that dress because it looks amazing on you! And after all was said and done I loved the fact that I had some poof and a train - even though a lot of people might have thought it was kind of crazy, I can't help but feel that it came out that much more beautiful (I'm sure I'm a little biased lol) - but the point is that it is your wedding day and your dream to come true... go with your heart!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kayla.brubaker@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.226.143.164","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1379723076,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273635.jpg?_r=1430276419","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KayRae","Id":273635,"Name":"KayRae","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79028,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"603004e68ad4fa3cee9a612d4818b6e9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"GingerBride\"] I think this dress looks great on you! I love it! The sweetheart and the belt are just perfect!! Honestly there is nothing traditional about a DW anyway.. thats the fun thing about it NO RULES!! so you can wear whatever you want its your wedding day!! But in all this is a great pick!! I hope you do say YES TO THE DRESS!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892124,"PostDate":1428414120,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279720\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279720-gingerbride\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">GingerBride<\/span><\/a> I think this dress looks great on you! I love it! The sweetheart and the belt are just perfect!! Honestly there is nothing traditional about a DW anyway.. thats the fun thing about it NO RULES!! so you can wear whatever you want its your wedding day!! But in all this is a great pick!! I hope you do say YES TO THE DRESS!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"racht33@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1422636588,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"racht33","Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.119.104.228","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79028,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f46c615de31bfefe8ab6542c15f0fb7d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"GingerBride\"] This dress looks amazing on you!!! Definitely love the belt, adds a little sparkle. My dress is totally not beachy either so don&#039;t let those thoughts of&amp;nbsp;\"I should wear a beachy dress\"&amp;nbsp;sway you!! It&#039;s your day, wear what makes you feel beautiful!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892130,"PostDate":1428418062,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279720\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279720-gingerbride\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">GingerBride<\/span><\/a> This dress looks amazing on you!!! Definitely love the belt, adds a little sparkle. My dress is totally not beachy either so don't let those thoughts of\u00a0\"I should wear a beachy dress\"\u00a0sway you!! It's your day, wear what makes you feel beautiful!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391807727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1433950078","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"190.241.252.27","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79028,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bdac4f3c536307b6518ad15da288f79a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;What a gorgeous dress! Definately belt I think. I am new here but I could not help but comment. I am trying to figure out some dress logistics myself right now! ;)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892188,"PostDate":1428437303,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>What a gorgeous dress! Definately belt I think. I am new here but I could not help but comment. I am trying to figure out some dress logistics myself right now! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cassidymichaels233@gmail.com","IpAddress":"190.241.252.27","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1428339137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"youngandinlove","Id":282649,"Name":"youngandinlove","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.224.109.228","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79028,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"54b1cefcc474adccad8afcfae6f68605","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"acw271011\"] thank you so much!! &amp;nbsp;It&#039;s a Stella York. &amp;nbsp;I was able to order it but it is now discontinued!! &amp;nbsp; I am so lucky as I don&#039;t think I would have loved any other dress as much as this one :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am a huge fan of the Stella York dresses. &amp;nbsp;They are so pretty and they have really good structure for the curvier girl :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"youngandinlove\"] thank you :) &amp;nbsp;Welcome to the message boards of so many giddy girls getting ready to marry the man of their dreams! &amp;nbsp;lol&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have been \"creeping\" the boards a long time now but only recently have I started to really post. &amp;nbsp;I notice that there are so many helpful ladies here. &amp;nbsp;So post away!&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;To everyone else who put in their vote - Thanks!!! &amp;nbsp;means so much to me to hear that I am choosing the right gown! &amp;nbsp;I just love it and I don&#039;t think I could imagine wearing another dress. &amp;nbsp;I will go shopping for a nice blinged out belt\/slash this weekend :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892214,"PostDate":1428448974,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a> thank you so much!! \u00a0It's a Stella York. \u00a0I was able to order it but it is now discontinued!! \u00a0 I am so lucky as I don't think I would have loved any other dress as much as this one <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am a huge fan of the Stella York dresses. \u00a0They are so pretty and they have really good structure for the curvier girl <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282649\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/282649-youngandinlove\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">youngandinlove<\/span><\/a> thank you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0Welcome to the message boards of so many giddy girls getting ready to marry the man of their dreams! \u00a0lol<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have been \"creeping\" the boards a long time now but only recently have I started to really post. \u00a0I notice that there are so many helpful ladies here. \u00a0So post away!<\/p>\n<br \/><p>To everyone else who put in their vote - Thanks!!! \u00a0means so much to me to hear that I am choosing the right gown! \u00a0I just love it and I don't think I could imagine wearing another dress. \u00a0I will go shopping for a nice blinged out belt\/slash this weekend <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stimaberry@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.212.163.15","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410098121,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279720.jpg?_r=1412546963","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GingerBride","Id":279720,"Name":"GingerBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.78.142","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79028,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"53a3aed4215ac0462faf070d2adf4057","RawContent":"You should comment! I lurked for awhile before posting but you get even more out of the site once you start interacting with all the lovely brides. Everyone is super supportive, nice and helpful!\n[quote name=\"youngandinlove\" post=\"1892188\" timestamp=\"1428433703\"]\nWhat a gorgeous dress! Definately belt I think. I am new here but I could not help but comment. I am trying to figure out some dress logistics myself right now! ;)[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1892295,"PostDate":1428507929,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>You should comment! I lurked for awhile before posting but you get even more out of the site once you start interacting with all the lovely brides. Everyone is super supportive, nice and helpful!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>youngandinlove, on 07 April 2015 - 12:08 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>What a gorgeous dress! Definately belt I think. I am new here but I could not help but comment. I am trying to figure out some dress logistics myself right now! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403119687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.147.118.47","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79028,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9d4ec119466fa052960b93b2b55bd7d1","RawContent":"@[member=\"GingerBride\"] beautiful dress! it looks great on you. love the belt - it sits perfectly. I&#039;m not a bling girl and to me this would be the perfect amount. congrats on saying yes!","Attachments":[],"Id":1892362,"PostDate":1428521737,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279720\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279720-gingerbride\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">GingerBride<\/span><\/a> beautiful dress! it looks great on you. love the belt - it sits perfectly. I'm not a bling girl and to me this would be the perfect amount. congrats on saying yes!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><br><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;0;116\/st\/20160607\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/1\/k\/bb99\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><br><\/a>","Email":"ashley.taylor@live.ca","IpAddress":"184.147.135.4","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423108661,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282006.png?_r=1423373502","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":138,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ashhtayy","Id":282006,"Name":"ashhtayy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.150.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79028,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"06a0b2aca7fec957a27af39436033cf6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"GingerBride\"] You look gorg :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892363,"PostDate":1428521994,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279720\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279720-gingerbride\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">GingerBride<\/span><\/a> You look gorg <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 10\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.theknot.com\/?utm_source=ticker&utm_medium=UBB&utm_campaign=tickers\"><img src=\"http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tickers\/tt1c2490.aspx\" alt=\"tt1c2490.aspx\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394136776,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":