n need of fashion advice for my upcoming \"just the two of us\" wedding at The Chapel of the Flowers in Las Vegas. Which dress should I choose? Pay no attention to the fit as they both are too tight and I have ordered the next size up.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;1) One Shoulder Ruffle Dress&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;2) Black Belt Dress&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1827174,"PostDate":1390076231,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Brides, I'm new here and in need of fashion advice for my upcoming \"just the two of us\" wedding at The Chapel of the Flowers in Las Vegas. Which dress should I choose? Pay no attention to the fit as they both are too tight and I have ordered the next size up.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>1) One Shoulder Ruffle Dress<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1827174]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2014\/post-276182-0-74158000-1390072530.png\" title=\"photo-3.png - Size: 120.38KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2014\/post-276182-0-74158000-1390072530.png\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"photo-3.png\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>2) Black Belt Dress<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1827174]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2014\/post-276182-0-57670700-1390072595.jpg\" title=\"photo-4.JPG - Size: 30.87KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2014\/post-276182-0-57670700-1390072595.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"photo-4.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicoletheshrink@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"108.20.79.233","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390075364,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Nicoletheshrink","Id":276182,"Name":"Nicoletheshrink","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.156.209.169","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76048,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"76fe05efc1073805e7af4412bf7d9ea9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Can&#039;t see either of them due to that 150 post thing. Any chance you can post a link to them instead?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1827221,"PostDate":1390091610,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Can't see either of them due to that 150 post thing. Any chance you can post a link to them instead?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rut