orgeous in both, but I really like the one with the black belt! Fits with a Las Vegas wedding! I guess it depends how formal you want it... The first one has a more shiny fabric, and the silver belt makes it really formal. The one with the black belt is still formal, and you can style it both up and down!","Attachments":[],"Id":1836175,"PostDate":1393726125,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                You are absolutely gorgeous in both, but I really like the one with the black belt! Fits with a Las Vegas wedding! I guess it depends how formal you want it... The first one has a more shiny fabric, and the silver belt makes it really formal. The one with the black belt is still formal, and you can style it both up and down! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"July 14th 2014, Taveuni Island, Fiji ","Email":"lilyaltier@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"79.160.23.45","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393681563,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276952.jpg?_r=1393789452","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LilyPotter","Id":276952,"Name":"LilyPotter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.14.5.191","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76048,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1393804082,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fb698bebc654ad91ed12cb6a7ca74ec7","RawContent"