{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.167.2.144","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79245,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2dbdcf10dd8abede3dc769859e8ffb84","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks, everyone! I just finished getting waxed and polished at the spa and I&#039;m 98% done with my packing so I&#039;d say I&#039;m in pretty good shape. I truley can&#039;t believe how calm I am. We got an expensive bottle of champagne as a gift for our engagement that we haven&#039;t drank - I think we may just need to pop that open and have a little quiet celebration tonight before we take off for this wild ride tomorrow morning!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Cheers! I&#039;ll catch you on the other side!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898018,"PostDate":1433619668,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks, everyone! I just finished getting waxed and polished at the spa and I'm 98% done with my packing so I'd say I'm in pretty good shape. I truley can't believe how calm I am. We got an expensive bottle of champagne as a gift for our engagement that we haven't drank - I think we may just need to pop that open and have a little quiet celebration tonight before we take off for this wild ride tomorrow morning!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Cheers! I'll catch you on the other side!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403119687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.126.252.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79245,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4a424414fe79af58508a15eba0d56dad","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;yay!! this is so exciting! I&#039;m sure you&#039;ll get the packing done :). somehow it seems we always find the time. Once I packed 4 hours before I had to be at the airport because I didn&#039;t know if I was traveling or not haha. I don&#039;t recommend going to that extreme, but just to show you that it will happen :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Best of luck on your wedding day\/week and I can&#039;t wait to hear more when you come back&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898020,"PostDate":1433628010,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>yay!! this is so exciting! I'm sure you'll get the packing done <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. somehow it seems we always find the time. Once I packed 4 hours before I had to be at the airport because I didn't know if I was traveling or not haha. I don't recommend going to that extreme, but just to show you that it will happen <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Best of luck on your wedding day\/week and I can't wait to hear more when you come back\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359766704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.179.187.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79245,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":6,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"234b2147c3c78a76e7a4c62b9d94293c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;I&#039;M BACK!!! I&#039;m going to start my recap thread shortly and will post all the details, but we had the best time and it was everything I had hoped for!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":32592,"Name":"D and B Ceremony.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-278581-0-20986100-1434557818.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-278581-0-20986100-1434557818_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":750},{"Id":32593,"Name":"Screen Shot 2015-06-16 at 8.05.02 PM.png","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-278581-0-36404700-1434557831.png","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2015\/post-278581-0-36404700-1434557831_thumb.png","Width":639,"Height":637}],"Id":1898764,"PostDate":1434561441,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">I'M BACK!!! I'm going to start my recap thread shortly and will post all the details, but we had the best time and it was everything I had hoped for!\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403119687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"Topi